      en: ["The original acacia was the only tree located within a 400-kilometer radius.", "Botanists discovered that its roots reached a depth of 35 meters to find water.", "The tree was destroyed in 1973 when it was hit by a heavy transport vehicle.", "A metal sculpture now stands in its place to serve as a desert landmark.", "The remains of the original tree are displayed at the National Museum in Niamey.", "The site is a major navigational waypoint between Agadez and the Kaouar oases."],
